### 1️⃣ Signup a new user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@123"
}

###

### 2️⃣ Login user (get JWT)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@primetrade.ai",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

###

### 3️⃣ Get user profile (protected route)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBwcmltZXRyYWRlLmFpIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiaWF0IjoxNzYwNDM0MTI5LCJleHAiOjE3NjA1MjA1Mjl9.1LfezR8LLubcMyAgnkvE_I3JwaefOGmfG5Pvw7zjT_w

